IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `td78-nouns`
IMPORT `td78-cross-references`

-- Row il-78. TESTS OF THE CONTROLS AND OF THE READINGS: the sound readings kept beside the two items. They pass.
-- Each control shows that a test finds what it looks for where it is there, so that a failing test in td78-tests-red.l4 is a result about the pages and not a test that cannot succeed.
-- The readings pin what the pages print: the dates, the numbers, the margin notes, the words.
-- The expected values are written from the quotation lines in td78-cross-references.l4 and from the printed pages, not copied from the values there.
-- No assertion here relates the date printed as the end of the order's period to the date printed as the start of the 2025 law; each date is tested against its own page only.

§ `Tests of the controls and of the readings`

-- ===== I1, controls =====

-- Control 1: the string "5(ב)" occurs in the 1995 print of regulation 18, and the token list has it.
#ASSERT `the regulation's words contain` `regulation 18 as printed in KT 5653` "5(ב)"
#ASSERT `the regulation names the token` `regulation 18 as printed in KT 5653` "5(ב)"
#ASSERT `the token is among the words of the citing regulation` `the reference in regulation 18 to 5(bet)`

-- Control 2: the strings "7(ד)" and "9(א)" occur in the 1995 print of regulation 18 and are the words item 5 deletes; the test finds the references that the 2007 instrument did remove.
#ASSERT `the regulation's words contain` `regulation 18 as printed in KT 5653` "7(ד)"
#ASSERT `the regulation's words contain` `regulation 18 as printed in KT 5653` "9(א)"
#ASSERT `the regulation's words contain` `regulation 18 as printed in KT 5653` "7(ד) ו־9(א)"
#ASSERT `KT 6586 item 5`'s `the words it deletes` EQUALS LIST "7(ד) ו־9(א)"
#ASSERT `the item deletes words that contain` `KT 6586 item 5` "7(ד)"
#ASSERT `the item deletes words that contain` `KT 6586 item 5` "9(א)"

-- Control 3: item 5 names "7(ד)" and "9(א)" and does not name "5(ב)" or "4(א)". The test counts what item 5 names; it finds "7(ד)" above, so its answer on "5(ב)" and "4(א)" is a count.
#ASSERT `the item's words contain` `KT 6586 item 5` "7(ד)"
#ASSERT `the item's words contain` `KT 6586 item 5` "9(א)"
#ASSERT NOT (`the item's words contain` `KT 6586 item 5` "5(ב)")
#ASSERT NOT (`the item's words contain` `KT 6586 item 5` "4(א)")
#ASSERT NOT (`the item deletes words that contain` `KT 6586 item 5` "5(ב)")

-- Control 4: regulation 5(ב) exists in the 1995 print, and the place the token names is the place of that print.
#ASSERT `the regulation's words contain` `regulation 5(bet) as printed in KT 5653` "1.5 מיליון שקלים חדשים"
#ASSERT `the place the token names is the place of the print typed beside it` `the reference in regulation 18 to 5(bet)`

-- Control 5: item 3 and item 5 are two different items of one instrument.
#ASSERT `the two items are two different items of one instrument` `KT 6586 item 3` `KT 6586 item 5`

-- Control 6: the predicate of the red assertion can say "outside": regulation 18, printed under the heading of chapter Dalet, lies outside the chapter item 3 repeals.
#ASSERT `the provision lies outside the chapter the item repeals` `regulation 18 as printed in KT 5653` `KT 6586 item 3`

-- Control 7: the title of the regulations as KT 5653 printed it contains the words item 1 deletes; the consolidation's title line (CONSOLIDATION-ONLY) does not, and its words are the title without them.
#ASSERT CONTAINS `the title of the preference regulations as KT 5653 printed it` "וחובת שיתוף פעולה עסקי"
#ASSERT `KT 6586 item 1`'s `the words it deletes` EQUALS LIST "וחובת שיתוף פעולה עסקי"
#ASSERT NOT (CONTAINS (`the title line of the consolidation, CONSOLIDATION-ONLY`'s `its words`) "וחובת שיתוף פעולה עסקי")

-- ===== I1, readings =====

-- The dates. The issue date is the date the footer prints; the signature date is the line under item 6; the page prints no calendar date for the start of the amending regulations.
#ASSERT `KT 5653`'s `its issue date` EQUALS Date 15 1 1995
#ASSERT `KT 6586`'s `its issue date` EQUALS Date 10 5 2007
#ASSERT `KT 6586`'s `its signature date` EQUALS JUST (Date 13 4 2007)
#ASSERT `KT 6586`'s `the date a section of it prints for its start` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `KT 5653`'s `its signature date` EQUALS NOTHING

-- The margin notes and numbers.
#ASSERT `regulation 18 as printed in KT 5653`'s `its margin note` EQUALS "עדכון"
#ASSERT `regulation 18 as printed in KT 5653`'s `the provisions it names, as tokens` EQUALS LIST "4(א)", "5(ב)", "7(ד)", "9(א)"
#ASSERT `regulation 18 as printed in KT 5653`'s `the printed page` EQUALS 567
#ASSERT `regulation 5(bet) as printed in KT 5653`'s `the printed page` EQUALS 564
#ASSERT `KT 6586 item 3`'s `its margin note` EQUALS "ביטול פרק ג׳"
#ASSERT `KT 6586 item 4`'s `its margin note` EQUALS "ביטול תקנה 15"
#ASSERT `KT 6586 item 5`'s `its margin note` EQUALS "תיקון תקנה 18"
#ASSERT `KT 6586 item 6`'s `its margin note` EQUALS "תחולה"
#ASSERT `KT 6586 item 3`'s `the chapter it names` EQUALS JUST `chapter Gimel`
#ASSERT `KT 6586 item 4`'s `the regulation it names` EQUALS JUST 15
#ASSERT `KT 6586 item 5`'s `the regulation it names` EQUALS JUST 18
#ASSERT `KT 6586 item 3`'s `the kind` EQUALS `repeal of a chapter`
#ASSERT `KT 6586 item 5`'s `the kind` EQUALS `deletion of words from a regulation`
#ASSERT `KT 6586 item 6`'s `the kind` EQUALS `application clause`

-- Where regulation 5(ב) is printed: on printed page 564, under the heading of chapter Gimel printed on that page; the heading of chapter Dalet is printed on printed page 567.
#ASSERT `regulation 5(bet) as printed in KT 5653`'s `the heading it is printed under` EQUALS JUST `the heading of chapter Gimel on printed page 564`
#ASSERT `the heading of chapter Gimel on printed page 564`'s `the printed page` EQUALS `regulation 5(bet) as printed in KT 5653`'s `the printed page`
#ASSERT `the heading of chapter Gimel on printed page 564`'s `the chapter` EQUALS `chapter Gimel`
#ASSERT `the heading of chapter Dalet on printed page 567`'s `the chapter` EQUALS `chapter Dalet`
#ASSERT `the heading of chapter Gimel on printed page 564`'s `the printed page` < `the heading of chapter Dalet on printed page 567`'s `the printed page`

-- The consolidation (UNOFFICIAL) prints "5(ב)" in its regulation 18, is read as CONSOLIDATION-ONLY, and tags the chapter, regulation 5 and regulation 18 with the same tag.
#ASSERT CONTAINS (`the lines of regulation 18 in the consolidation, CONSOLIDATION-ONLY`'s `its words`) "5(ב)"
#ASSERT `the lines of regulation 18 in the consolidation, CONSOLIDATION-ONLY`'s `how it was read` EQUALS `CONSOLIDATION-ONLY`
#ASSERT `the heading line of chapter Gimel in the consolidation, CONSOLIDATION-ONLY`'s `its amendment tags` EQUALS "תיקון: תשס״ז"
#ASSERT `the lines of regulation 5 in the consolidation, CONSOLIDATION-ONLY`'s `its amendment tags` EQUALS "תיקון: תשס״ז"
#ASSERT `the lines of regulation 18 in the consolidation, CONSOLIDATION-ONLY`'s `its amendment tags` EQUALS "תיקון: תשס״ז"

-- Limb (b): the instruments the consolidation's header box lists were all read. The test finds an instruction where one is (KT 6586); it finds none in the three later instruments read.
#ASSERT `KT 6586 read for limb (b)`'s `it carries an instruction on regulation 18, regulation 5 or chapter Gimel`
#ASSERT all (GIVEN l YIELD NOT (l's `it carries an instruction on regulation 18, regulation 5 or chapter Gimel`)) (LIST `KT 7027 read for limb (b)`, `KT 7543 read for limb (b)`, `KT 10771 read for limb (b)`)
#ASSERT all (GIVEN pg YIELD (pg EQUALS 562) OR (any (GIVEN l YIELD l's `its first printed page` EQUALS pg) `the instruments read for limb (b) of I1`)) `the printed pages the header box lists for the regulations, CONSOLIDATION-ONLY`
#ASSERT `the instruments read for limb (b) of I1` EQUALS LIST `KT 6586 read for limb (b)`, `KT 7027 read for limb (b)`, `KT 7543 read for limb (b)`, `KT 10771 read for limb (b)`
#ASSERT `KT 6586`'s `its issue date` < `KT 7027`'s `its issue date`
#ASSERT `KT 7027`'s `its issue date` < `KT 7543`'s `its issue date`
#ASSERT `KT 7543`'s `its issue date` < `KT 10771`'s `its issue date`
#ASSERT `the printed pages the regulations' consolidation lists as the extension of the temporary provision, CONSOLIDATION-ONLY` EQUALS LIST (`the 2015 law as printed in SH 2495`'s `the printed page`), (`the 2020 law as printed in SH 2827`'s `the printed page`), (`the order of 2023 as printed in KT 10718`'s `the printed page`)

#ASSERT `I1`'s `limb (a) holds`
#ASSERT `I1`'s `limb (b) holds`
#ASSERT `both limbs hold` `I1`

-- ===== I2, controls =====

-- Control 1: the 2020 law's section 2 prints the quoted paragraph headed by the numeral 3, and the paragraph holds the words of the power; the tests find the numeral and the words when they are there.
#ASSERT `a section of the law prints a quoted paragraph headed by` 3 `the 2020 law as printed in SH 2827`
#ASSERT `the section's quoted paragraph contains` "להאריך בשנתיים נוספות את התקופה הקבועה בסעיף 1" `section 2 of the 2020 law`
#ASSERT `the quoted paragraph of section 2 of the 2020 law`'s `the margin note printed beside it` EQUALS "הארכת תוקף הוראת השעה"

-- Control 2: the 2015 law's section 1 contains the period words "חמש שנים", and so does the section of the 2020 law that replaces them.
#ASSERT `the section's words contain` "חמש שנים" `section 1 of the 2015 law`
#ASSERT `the section's words contain` "חמש שנים" `section 1 of the 2020 law`
#ASSERT `the section's words contain` "שמונה שנים" `section 1 of the 2020 law`

-- Control 3: the 2015 law prints numbered sections 1 and 2 and no numbered section 3; the test counts the numbered sections of that print, 2.
#ASSERT `the law prints a numbered section` 1 `the 2015 law as printed in SH 2495`
#ASSERT `the law prints a numbered section` 2 `the 2015 law as printed in SH 2495`
#ASSERT NOT (`the law prints a numbered section` 3 `the 2015 law as printed in SH 2495`)
#ASSERT `the number of numbered sections the law prints` `the 2015 law as printed in SH 2495` EQUALS 2

-- Control 4: the order's footnote 1 names both page 197 of the 2015 print and page 228 of the 2020 print.
#ASSERT `some footnote contains` "ס״ח התשע״ה, עמ׳ 197" (`the order of 2023 as printed in KT 10718`'s `its footnotes`)
#ASSERT `some footnote contains` "התש״ף, עמ׳ 228" (`the order of 2023 as printed in KT 10718`'s `its footnotes`)

-- Control 5: the order and the 2020 law are two different issues, KT 10718 and SH 2827.
#ASSERT `the two instruments are two different issues` `KT 10718` `SH 2827`

-- Control 6: the order's opening words print, before the defined term, the title of the 2020 law as SH 2827 prints it.
#ASSERT `the title in the opening words is the title of the law the term is bound to` `the order of 2023 as printed in KT 10718`
#ASSERT `the order of 2023 as printed in KT 10718`'s `the law the opening words define the term as`'s `its title` EQUALS "חוק חובת המכרזים (תיקון מס׳ 24 – הוראת שעה) (תיקון), התש״ף–2020"

-- Control 7: the test for the words "סעיף 3" finds them where they are, in the margin note of section 2 of the 2020 law, and finds them in no section of the 2025 law.
#ASSERT CONTAINS (`section 2 of the 2020 law`'s `its margin note`) "סעיף 3"
#ASSERT NOT (any (GIVEN s YIELD CONTAINS (s's `its words`) "סעיף 3") (`the 2025 law as printed in SH 3443`'s `its sections`))
#ASSERT `the section's words contain` "בסעיף 1" `section 1 of the 2025 law`

-- ===== I2, readings =====

-- The numbered sections each print: the 2015 law, the 2020 law, the 2025 law and the order each print two.
#ASSERT `the law prints a numbered section` 1 `the 2020 law as printed in SH 2827`
#ASSERT `the law prints a numbered section` 2 `the 2020 law as printed in SH 2827`
#ASSERT `the number of numbered sections the law prints` `the 2020 law as printed in SH 2827` EQUALS 2
#ASSERT `the number of numbered sections the law prints` `the 2025 law as printed in SH 3443` EQUALS 2
#ASSERT count (`the order of 2023 as printed in KT 10718`'s `its sections`) EQUALS 2
#ASSERT `section 1 of the 2020 law`'s `its margin note` EQUALS "תיקון סעיף 1"
#ASSERT `section 2 of the 2020 law`'s `its margin note` EQUALS "הוספת סעיף 3"
#ASSERT `section 1 of the 2015 law`'s `its margin note` EQUALS "תיקון סעיף 3א"
#ASSERT `section 2 of the 2015 law`'s `its margin note` EQUALS "חובת התקנת תקנות ותוקף תקנות"
#ASSERT `section 1 of the 2025 law`'s `its margin note` EQUALS "תיקון סעיף 1"
#ASSERT `section 2 of the 2025 law`'s `its margin note` EQUALS "תחילה"
#ASSERT `section 1 of the order`'s `its margin note` EQUALS "הארכת תוקף הוראת השעה"
#ASSERT `section 2 of the order`'s `its margin note` EQUALS "תחילה"

-- The order's two pointers: the power cited as section 3 of the law its opening words define, and section 1 of it cited in section 1 of the order.
#ASSERT `the order of 2023 as printed in KT 10718`'s `the section number the opening words cite for the power` EQUALS 3
#ASSERT `the order of 2023 as printed in KT 10718`'s `the section number its section 1 cites` EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the law prints a numbered section` (`the order of 2023 as printed in KT 10718`'s `the section number its section 1 cites`) (`the order of 2023 as printed in KT 10718`'s `the law the opening words define the term as`)

-- The dates as printed, each with its own source: issue dates, the order's signature date, the start date its section 2 prints, the end date its section 1 prints, and the start date section 2 of the 2025 law prints.
#ASSERT `KT 10718`'s `its issue date` EQUALS Date 13 7 2023
#ASSERT `KT 10718`'s `its signature date` EQUALS JUST (Date 12 7 2023)
#ASSERT `KT 10718`'s `the date a section of it prints for its start` EQUALS JUST (Date 16 7 2023)
#ASSERT `the order of 2023 as printed in KT 10718`'s `the date its section 1 prints as the end of the period` EQUALS JUST (Date 15 7 2025)
#ASSERT `SH 2827`'s `its issue date` EQUALS Date 15 7 2020
#ASSERT `SH 2495`'s `its issue date` EQUALS Date 15 7 2015
#ASSERT `SH 3443`'s `its issue date` EQUALS Date 15 7 2025
#ASSERT `SH 3443`'s `the date a section of it prints for its start` EQUALS JUST (Date 16 7 2025)
#ASSERT `SH 2827`'s `the date a section of it prints for its start` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `SH 2495`'s `the date a section of it prints for its start` EQUALS NOTHING

-- The pages and the family of the later instrument: the pages the Law's consolidation lists for the family match the pages of the four instruments typed here (CONSOLIDATION-ONLY as to the list).
#ASSERT `the printed pages the header box lists for the 2015 law, the 2020 law, the 2025 law and the order, CONSOLIDATION-ONLY` EQUALS LIST (`the 2015 law as printed in SH 2495`'s `the printed page`), (`the 2020 law as printed in SH 2827`'s `the printed page`), (`the 2025 law as printed in SH 3443`'s `the printed page`), (`the order of 2023 as printed in KT 10718`'s `the printed page`)
#ASSERT `some footnote contains` "ק״ת התשפ״ג, עמ׳ 2104" (`the 2025 law as printed in SH 3443`'s `its footnotes`)

#ASSERT `I2`'s `limb (a) holds`
#ASSERT `I2`'s `limb (b) holds`
#ASSERT `both limbs hold` `I2`
